                    "**2. Extensions:** $(x+a)(x+b) = x^2+(a+b)x+ab$.",
                    "**3. Cubes:** $(x+y)^3 = x^3+y^3+3xy(x+y)$, $x^3+y^3+z^3-3xyz = (x+y+z)(x^2+y^2+z^2-xy-yz-zx)$.",
                    "**4. Conditional:** If $x+y+z=0$, then $x^3+y^3+z^3=3xyz$."
                ],
                "formulas": [
                    {
                        "rule": "Trinomial Square",
